#: index.docbook:59
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Introduction"

#: index.docbook:61
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"&kab; is an address book for use with &kde;2 that lets you save names, "
"postal, email, talk and <acronym>www</acronym>"
" addresses, telephone numbers, important dates and other information in a "
"card index form."
msgstr ""
"&kab; est un carnet d'adresse pour &kde; il vous permet de sauvegarder le "
"nom, le code postal, l'email, l'adresse de talk et<acronym>www</acronym>"
", le numéro de téléphone, des dates importantes et d'autres informations "
"dans des champspersonnalisables."

